.gradle/
**/build/
local.properties
runtime-build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.jks
*.keystore

# Large artifacts are distributed as GitHub Release assets.
# runtime-native-manifest.json (split 布局) 是小体积契约文件，产出后必须提交；
# 仅 jniLibs 本机二进制本体走源码 zip 分发，不进 git。
dist/
app/src/main/assets/runtime.zip
app/src/main/jniLibs/
*.apk

# Never publish local authentication state, captures, or private signing material.
.credentials.yaml
.credentials.yml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
screenshots/
captures/

# 协议探针原始捕获：含宿主路径等本机信息，只留本地；进入仓库的是脱敏 fixtures 与笔记
protocol/captures/
